  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h2>Website purpose</h2>
    <p>This website presents AKMICS — Sailpreneur Academy and its cruise-career mentorship and professional-preparation services. Its content is general program information and career exploration guidance.</p>
    <h2>Mentorship scope</h2>
    <p>Mentorship may cover career direction, CV and application preparation, interviews, hospitality and hygiene knowledge, documentation guidance and personal development. It does not guarantee employment, placement, salary, visa approval or promotion.</p>
    <h2>Recruitment and official requirements</h2>
    <p>Employers and recruiters make hiring decisions. Visa authorities decide visa applications. Authorised maritime training and certification providers handle the relevant training and certificates. Always confirm the requirements that apply to your role and circumstances.</p>
    <h2>Program arrangements</h2>
    <p>Confirm the current fee, duration, format, inclusions, payment terms and cancellation or refund conditions with the academy before enrolling. This website does not offer payment checkout or establish a completed enrolment.</p>
    <h2>Student stories</h2>
    <p>Success stories and quotes are shared by AKMICS students. They describe individual journeys and do not promise equivalent results.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For questions about the mentorship or current enrolment terms, contact the team through <a href="/contact/">the academy’s contact page</a>.</p>
